  Android draws a notification's small icon as a mask — one colour, with the shape's alpha kept and
  its colours thrown away — so the app's launcher icon, which is a picture, would arrive as a black
  square. One path, filled even-odd, so the dots are holes in the bubble rather than their own discs.
-->
